1516
04:32:27,800 --> 04:32:28,180
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: Yes, Your Honor.

1517
04:32:28,180 --> 04:32:32,540
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Dahil this morning lang sinabi niyo, you believe na merong nakontrata?

1518
04:32:33,770 --> 04:32:45,510
