1521
04:33:32,280 --> 04:33:45,820
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: Now, insofar as kung sino iyong kinausap na iyon, and insofar as iyong existence ng tao na iyon, ang makakasagot po noon, Your Honor, since trabaho nila iyon, iyong aming intelligence service po o kaya iyong aming director.

1522
04:33:46,180 --> 04:33:46,240
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: So your

1523
04:33:46,240 --> 04:33:50,120
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: belief came from the statements of

1524
04:33:50,120 --> 04:33:51,440
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Vice President Sara?

1525
04:33:51,620 --> 04:33:51,700
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: Yes, Your Honor. No

1526
04:33:51,700 --> 04:33:54,160
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: more. Statements and admission, sir.

1527
04:33:55,460 --> 04:33:57,580
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: So doon lang nanggaling? Wala nang iba?

1528
04:33:58,960 --> 04:34:01,620
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: In so far as the Cybercrime Division, Your Honor, yes.

1529
04:34:01,960 --> 04:34:08,400
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Okay. And then, meron din siyang reply. Sinabi niyo nga kanina, nagpadala kayo ng letter.

1530
04:34:10,780 --> 04:34:12,740
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: Dated... December

1531
04:34:12,770 --> 04:34:13,870
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: 2, Your Honor. December

1532
04:34:13,870 --> 04:34:24,670
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: 2. And may reply rin si VP na dine-deny niya na merong grave threat. So pag dine-deny niya na ginawa niya ang grave threat, obviously, dine-deny niya na may...

1533
04:34:26,570 --> 04:34:35,570
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: So, bakit pa rin ninyo i-file or re-recommend na mag-file ng grave threat in inciting to sedition kung may denial na?

1534
04:34:36,660 --> 04:34:52,750
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: Hindi ho, Your Honor. Ang na-establish po namin doon iyong elements of the crime of grave threats. So, noong nakita namin na na-satisfy at na-comply iyon, noong na-refer po namin ito sa Department of Justice—

1535
04:34:52,750 --> 04:34:59,710
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: Nag-concur sa amin ang Department of Justice na indeed na-comply namin, and therefore tuloy iyong proseso ng preliminary investigation.

1536
04:34:59,710 --> 04:35:00,250
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: But what made

1537
04:35:00,250 --> 04:35:17,910
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: you not... Bakit hindi ninyo tinanggap itong paliwanag ni VP Sara sa kanyang letter? Dahil kaagad dito sa letter niya may denial na ginawa niya yung grave threat and therefore wala rin na kontrata kasi magkadugtong yun.

1538
04:35:18,050 --> 04:35:49,530
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: Well, Your Honor... Mere denial would not discount the fact na na-atter niya yon at may kinausap na siyang mga tao. Yun nga ang problema dun kaya namin siya gustong makausap personally para makapag tanong pa kami ng other questions para makita namin totoo ba tong kinontrata ng vicepresidente o kinausap o hindi. Kaya lang yung honor wala ho doon hindi ho siya nag-appear. Yung kanyang sagot is Justine

1539
04:35:49,370 --> 04:36:07,870
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: mere denial lang, walang mga basehan, even circumstantial na basehan. So hindi ho namin siya sinama sa factor in considering whether or not a crime of grave threat has been committed by the Vice President.

1540
04:36:08,130 --> 04:36:10,930
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: With your permission, Mr. Presiding Officer, just one last question.

1541
04:36:11,400 --> 04:36:15,420
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Nakita niyo ba kung merong capability si Vice President Sara? Definitely,

1542
04:36:15,780 --> 04:36:16,680
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: definitely po.

1543
04:36:16,820 --> 04:36:25,180
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: Ano ang nakita niyong mga ebedensya kung meron siyang capability gawin yung kanyang sinabing pagbanta at yung kanyang gagawin?

1544
04:36:25,560 --> 04:36:36,080
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: Well, for one, she is the Vice President of the Republic of the Philippines. And number two, hindi

1545
04:36:36,080 --> 04:36:40,900
Sen. Sherwin T. Gatchalian: naman porket Vice President ka, may capability ka gumawa nun. Yes,

1546
04:36:41,320 --> 04:36:47,140
