1575
04:42:31,180 --> 04:42:34,240
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Salamat, Mr. Presiding Officer. Mr. Witness.

1576
04:42:34,640 --> 04:42:35,180
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: Yes, Your Honor.

1577
04:42:36,020 --> 04:42:44,000
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Nabanggit niyo kay Sen. Judge Ejercito, hindi ngayon lang, kanina, iyong admission against interest.

1578
04:42:45,560 --> 04:42:53,960
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Sabi niyo po ang mga pahayag ng vicepresidente ay maituturing na admissions against interest. Tama po?

1579
04:42:54,200 --> 04:42:55,060
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: Yes, ma'am.

1580
04:42:55,690 --> 04:43:06,530
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: May diferensya po ba sa pagtrato sa pahayag ng isang tao kung pabor sa kanya o against sa interest niya ang admission?

1581
04:43:07,210 --> 04:43:54,750
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: I think so, ma'am. Kasi base dito sa issue natin, Ang vice-presidente is abogada. Alam na po niya yun na the moment she uttered those kind of statements, pwede ho siyang mag-fall in any criminal violation. So pagdating ho nung November 26, instead of avoiding mentioning those utterances, instead of denying that she made those utterances, ang sinabi po niya, nire-iterate niya. Yes, sinabi ko yan na someone has to take revenge. Kung sakaling mangyari ito, mamatay ako.

1582
04:43:56,510 --> 04:43:58,370
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: Yun po, Your Honor, ang nakita namin.

1583
04:44:00,340 --> 04:44:03,420
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: Kaya ako nasabi na admission against interest po yun.

1584
04:44:04,060 --> 04:44:27,430
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: So kung sa halip na i-reiterate niya, i-deny niya yung naunang sinabi, kung sinabi niya na Hindi ko talaga minimin yan or may sinabi siyang maituturing na pabor sa kanya. Iba po yung pagtrato nyo sa ganyang klaseng pahayag sana.

1585
04:44:27,670 --> 04:44:32,060
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: Baka maging iba, Your Honor. Okay.

1586
04:44:33,290 --> 04:44:43,410
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: So ano po yung diferensya at saka halaga dun sa bigat na binibigay ng batas dun sa admission against interest?

1587
04:44:45,830 --> 04:45:13,210
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: Well, pinapakita ko rito, in the natural order of things, hindi ho ia-admit ng isang tao yung isang bagay na ikakasira niya o na ikakaharap niya sa isang paglilites, something like that. Kapag ho inadmit ng isang tao yung isang bagay na ikakasira niya, maliwanag na ginawa niya yun, sinabi niya yun, at determinado siya.

1588
04:45:13,210 --> 04:45:17,620
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: sa mga pangyayaring iyon o pursigido siya sa mga pangyayaring iyon.

1589
04:45:17,970 --> 04:45:32,360
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: So, masasabi po bang mabigat o napakabigat ang halaga na ibinibigay sa ilalim ng batas sa isang admission against interest?

1590
04:45:32,660 --> 04:45:33,640
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: Yes. Yes, Your Honor, Apo.

1591
04:45:34,330 --> 04:45:46,010
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Panghuli na lang po, Mr. Witness. Bakit nga po pinaparusahan ng batas ang grave threats kahit Pa hindi na tuloy sa physical act?

1592
04:45:47,420 --> 04:46:28,430
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: Well, Your Honor, for purposes of peace and order among the populace, pag hindi ho in-address yung speeches o yung utterances na magka-qualify as grave threat, magkakagulo ho yung mga tao. Pwede na lang ho sabihin kahit na sino na papatayin kita pag ito nangyari. Gagawin ko ito sa'yo pag ito nangyari. So I think the wisdom of the law is to avoid the disorder, the anarchy, and the chaos that it would create, Your Honor.

1593
04:46:28,750 --> 04:46:36,760
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: So yung sinasabi niyong wisdom of the law ay hindi lamang sitahin o Pwede po yun yung

1594
04:46:36,760 --> 04:46:43,580
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: isang bagay na tumuloy sa physical act kundi mag-serve ng deterrent? Para gawin

1595
04:46:43,580 --> 04:46:44,500
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: ngayon ng

1596
04:46:44,500 --> 04:46:46,260
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: taong iyon o ng ibang tao

1597
04:46:46,260 --> 04:46:50,100
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: yung grave threats? Pwede po yun, Your Honor. To serve as a deterrent, Your Honor.

1598
04:46:51,180 --> 04:46:55,120
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: So may preventive na value din nakikita kayo?

1599
04:46:55,220 --> 04:46:56,000
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: Yes po, Your Honor.

1600
04:46:56,220 --> 04:46:57,160
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Bukod sa curative?

1601
04:46:57,620 --> 04:46:58,420
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: Opo, Your Honor.

1602
04:46:59,020 --> 04:47:01,320
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Salamat po, Mr. Witness. Salamat po, Presiding Officer.

1603
04:47:01,930 --> 04:47:12,950
