1609
04:47:45,740 --> 04:47:49,140
Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: Before, Sir. Before? I think that's before, Sir.

1610
04:47:49,220 --> 04:47:55,810
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: So would it be possible na because of that, nakapag-isip siya na mayroon threat against her life?

1611
04:47:56,690 --> 04:48:07,330
