Atty. Jeremy C. Lotoc: Very much possible, sir. Opo.

1613
04:48:10,430 --> 04:48:15,230
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: But hindi ninyo ba inimbestigahan bakit na-pull out iyong security details niya?

1614
04:48:15,230 --> 04:48:44,620
